thenticated runtime custody to issue #1751 and keep the #1750 historical builder successor-aware and zero-write\n- raw-bind the #1751 active manifest in the historical #1750 validator before JSON parsing and verify the matching runtime authority\n\n## Authority and scope\n\n- exact predecessor commit: `04884db721211d57a812c011178439f3df1b5479`\n- exact predecessor tree: `8f4e754db2eee33970a85e3bd1c7e02e8b93e432`\n- predecessor manifest: `a35228bc67a850a8528d3c915cd09b5b70b4665c2810d4ae3d91652cf9abc6d1`\n- Circular Measure delta: `2fad0b43b86fa87dba88bb298e5c8797ae6dae383b7a692fd8aaa8ef54352e6e`\n- cumulative projection: `92599c2e4ce06ae8d4fbd832491cce495035ac031e1f4d269ad4679c52656639`\n- product readback: `3a77402bb7b50e7bb736cb78819bd56db164042011696a423748fe241bec0f12`\n- active manifest: `b9110c2c16f3c9c68fe38783a0ae7f4dc832e503903584c7fd3ffff5009d8e80` / 12415 bytes\n\n## Semantic review\n\n- 71 discoverable source rows; 70 structurally verified questions; one explicit unavailable source row (`qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q09`) remains unexposed\n- 147 reviewed score-owning parts: 136 approved Circular Measure primary and 11 foreign-primary candidates\n- 398 evidence-bound ProcedureInstances: 282 approved and 116 candidate/withheld\n- 17 official alternative branches retained at QuestionPart/ProcedureInstance grain\n- 4 canonical ProcedureModels with reuse ratio 70.5\n- radians boundary: circle-owned central-angle demands are Circular Measure; standalone triangle or coordinate angle demands remain foreign-primary\n- supporting candidates remain isolated with exact evidence: Trigonometry 105, Coordinate Geometry 6, Differentiation 2, Quadratics 2, Functions 1\n- unit conversion, arithmetic substitution, routine rearrangement, and diagram reading remain evidence/steps rather than standalone models\n- candidate-as-approved, candidate namespace, unresolved model refs, provider calls, remote writes, and structural authority writes are all zero\n\n## Review repairs\n\n- #1750 historical validation admits the #1751 active manifest only when its actual raw receipt equals the external fixed authority: `b9110c2c...8e80`, 12415 bytes\n- raw receipt is checked before JSON parsing or semantic acceptance; noncanonical whitespace, `write_posture`, and coverage-metric tampering fail closed\n- repository runtime authority independently identifies issue #1751 and the same manifest SHA-256\n- all final Circular Measure question records recompute `semantic_record_sha256` only after decision/tag/procedure-reference mutation and sorting; validator independently recomputes every digest and rejects post-hash mutation\n- candidate isolation cross-references exact current candidate ProcedureInstance IDs against both projection node IDs and every edge endpoint, with node and edge injection tests\n- non-check #1750 historical replay can recreate a missing active manifest while successor-present replay remains authenticated and zero-write\n\n## Verification\n\n- both #1750/#1751 builder `--check` commands pass\n- #1750 focused semantic/custody/adversarial suite — 20/20\n- #1751 focused semantic/custody/adversarial suite — 19/19\n- complete P1 semantic chain #1744-#1751 — 115/115\n- retained P3 semantic chain #1722-#1727 — 61/61\n- authenticated service/API/real-gateway Jest suites — 99/99\n- focused ESLint, Python compile, and `git diff --check`\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T04:02:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T04:59:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T04:45:47Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T04:45:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"0670b1720110093d736cdae71805a7ba70ba5c00","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1761/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1761/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https:/